@startuml F0.2-c-reset-rate-limit
title F0.2-c — Solicitar reset — 429 rate limit
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "RateLimitFilter" as RateLimit

Usuario -> WebApp: nova tentativa / Enviar link
WebApp -> RateLimit: POST /auth/recuperar-senha

note right of RateLimit
  ≥ 3 solicitações / hora
  (e-mail + IP)
  ForgotPasswordUseCase
  nunca invocado
  RN-F0.2-08
end note

RateLimit --> WebApp: 429 Problem Details\n(+ retryAfterSeconds)
WebApp --> Usuario: botão desabilitado\naté liberar

@enduml
